title: AWS Classic Load Balancer
agents: aws
catalog: cloud/aws
license: WTFPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors AWS Classic Elastic Load Balancer (ELB) metrics via CloudWatch.
 It provides visibility into load balancer performance and health.

 Monitored metrics:

 - Request Count: Total number of requests processed

 - Latency: Average request latency in milliseconds

 - Healthy/Unhealthy Host Count: Number of healthy and unhealthy backend hosts

 - HTTP Error Codes: ELB 4XX/5XX and Backend 4XX/5XX counts

 Thresholds can be configured for latency and unhealthy host count.

discovery:
 One service is created for each Classic Load Balancer discovered.
